@startuml
title Implemented WebSocket search progress
actor Client
participant "WebSocket /ws/search" as WS
participant "Cached WebSocket executor" as Pool
participant SearchService as Search
participant OllamaService as Ollama
participant InvertedIndex as Index

Client -> WS: connect
Client -> WS: {requestId, query, mode}
WS --> Client: started
WS -> Pool: submit search task
Pool -> Search: search(request, listener)
alt mode = llm
 Search -> Ollama: expandQuery(query)
 Ollama --> Search: terms / fallback warning
 Search --> WS: query_expansion
 WS --> Client: query_expansion
end
Search -> Index: search each term
Index --> Search: document IDs
Search --> WS: keyword_search
WS --> Client: keyword_search
Search --> WS: done(SearchResponse)
WS --> Client: done
note right of WS
Every event has requestId,
stage and timestamp.
Each connection has an isolated
set of cancellable tasks.
end note
@enduml
